Z||000001||Archie||05-27-2001||01:15 AM||||Wouldn't that be neat if someone had a convert kit that was affordable.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/top_2.jpg"> <P>Back in the early 90's I installed Fred's tops on 3 customer cars. I love them...... the quality, fit & finish were wonderful.<P>Fred hasn't made the tops in years, his old tooling is rotting away in some rust pile & there is still a demand for a quality convet top.<P>I believe this very well could be the last of Fred's tops that hasn't been installed on a Fiero.<P>I'm quite pleased.<P>Archie||||reg||1
Z||000002||Nashco||05-27-2001||01:48 AM||||Archie, don't hold out on us <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Any plans to use the top for some new tooling?  Is this a "someday I might make it" project, or a "this will be worth a ton" part?  I hoping it's the first one!<P>Let us know if your wheels are turning on this one <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I think the converts look way better than a standard coupe, and it'd give me a great reason to take my buddy's coupe out of the yard.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
